Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Make the blinder button legible as a momentary control

The button fired, but nothing about it read as working: the flash decayed in
under half a second behind the desk section's scrim, the button showed no
state, and on themes that patch blinders out (Relax, Focus, Sleep) it did
nothing at all with no explanation.

- Hold to fire: pointer down (or the B key) holds the blinders at full
  output, release starts the decay.
- Blinders now lift the whole frame, not just two pools, since they point at
  the audience.
- Pressing when the fixture is patched out switches it on and says so.
- The button lights while it is firing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018JjAD7WNZmP26cnkvFDZws
